WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.934
Pre-selection begins in

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.235
Dominion voting systems.

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:05.972
$1.6 billion defamation case against Fox.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.841
Now the trial is still moving forward,

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:08.708
despite the judge

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.642
sanctioning Fox

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:10.577
for withholding evidence

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:13.646
and its plans to appoint a special master

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.147
to investigate

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.016
whether the right wing network lied to

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.017
the court.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.451
Fox has denied any

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.919
wrongdoing in the case.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.654
In a pretrial hearing yesterday, Dominion

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:22.789
also played

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.025
previously unaired audio of Fox host

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.760
Maria Bartiromo

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.162
and former Trump lawyer Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.563
Discussing whether Dominion had

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:33.633
ties to top Democrats, which is a claim

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:36.302
the network's guest made in 2020.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.305
What about the software

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:42.442
of this Dominion software?

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.778
That's a little troubling

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:45.578
to tell you, right?

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:48.381
It's being it's being analyzed right now.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.283
I mean, there are a couple of races

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.818
that have been reversed

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:54.120
because the Democrat was triple

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.289
counted, two already in Michigan.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:58.258
Now, whether that

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.592
applies for the whole state or not,

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.661
I can't tell you yet.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.031
But I can tell you that

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.100
if we have more

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.401
than we have more than enough

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.470
unobserved ballots

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:13.773
in Michigan and in Pennsylvania

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:16.443
to overthrow the election.

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.078
Okay, perfect.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.612
And then just give me a hint.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:20.613
Software you get

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.283
because you have an interest in it.

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:25.685
I've read that.

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:28.488
I can't prove that. Okay.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:30.890
I was in the courthouse right behind us

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:31.891
when they played

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.893
that tape that you just played.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.662
And when the judge heard it,

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:37.597
he said it was extremely relevant

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:38.565
to this case.

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.033
And he wanted to know why

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.302
Fox had only turned it over to Dominion

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.003
last week.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.506
This case has been going on since 20, 21.

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:47.407
But Dominion

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:50.944
says it only got this material last week.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.278
The judge

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:55.615
has decided to appoint a special master

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.917
to investigate Fox to figure out,

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:58.685
number one

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:00.320
if they intentionally withheld

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.921
this tape and other tapes.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:02.655
And number two,

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:04.390
if there's anything else out there

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.693
that Fox needs to turn over to Dominion

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.728
as part of the discovery process,

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:10.063
a pretty big development

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:11.664
on the brink of trial.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.133
And I do want to point out that Fox

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.268
says that they've done nothing wrong.

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.303
Fox said that they turned over this tape

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:18.238
and related tapes

00:02:18.238 --> 00:02:19.772
as soon as they learned about it

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.141
in a related lawsuit

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:22.742
just a few weeks ago.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:23.610
But clearly,

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.345
with this trial commencing

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:26.179
as we speak,

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:27.847
they're already in some hot water.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:28.982
Fox's reputation

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.949
and that of its biggest

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:31.651
stars are on the line here.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.286
We are now underway in this trial

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:34.387
with a lot of fireworks

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:36.055
expected over the next several weeks.

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:38.491
The curtain

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.826
officially raised in

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.928
what could be an explosive trial.

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:42.695
Jury selection

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:45.732
started today in the $1.6 billion lawsuit

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:46.900
against Fox News

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.801
brought by Dominion Voting Systems.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:49.869
Potential jurors

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.070
asked if they regularly

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.705
watch Fox News programs

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:54.407
and whether they can still be impartial

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:55.375
if they do.

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:56.242
Simply knowing

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:57.610
a story isn't enough

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.112
to get someone kicked off of a jury

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:00.079
because judges

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:02.348
often instruct your will, instruct jurors

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.050
to put aside anything they know

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.485
about the case beforehand

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:06.786
and pledge to be fair.

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:08.021
Tonight, you are watching

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:09.656
the case centers around Fox's

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:11.090
decision to allow strange,

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.091
inaccurate claims

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.927
about Dominion onto its airwaves

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:15.728
after the 2020 election

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:17.096
to promote the false theory

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.231
that the election was stolen

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:19.299
from Donald Trump.

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:20.867
Electronic voting machines

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:23.403
didn't allow people to vote, apparently,

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:24.270
and that whatever

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.838
you think of it, the cause of it,

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:27.840
it shakes people's faith in the system

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:30.410
that is an actual threat to democracy.

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:31.678
Host Tucker Carlson

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.479
part of an array of high profile

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.981
Fox hosts and executives

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.549
expected to take the stand.

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:38.618
A roster including Sean Hannity,

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:39.686
Laura Ingraham,

00:03:39.686 --> 00:03:41.287
Fox Chairman Rupert Murdoch

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.523
and Fox News CEO Suzanne Scott.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.591
But analyst Erik

00:03:44.591 --> 00:03:46.593
Wemple says much of Dominion's case

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:47.760
will likely center around

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.461
second tier

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:50.063
stars like Lou Dobbs,

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:52.165
Jeanine Pirro and Maria Bartiromo.

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:52.899
Sidney,

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:54.968
we talked about the Dominion software.

00:03:54.968 --> 00:03:56.369
I know that there were

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:58.104
voting irregularities.

00:03:58.104 --> 00:03:59.372
Tell me about that.

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.640
Those people,

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.775
they're state of mind is going to play

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:04.110
a really big role in this.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:04.944
What did they know?

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:05.979
When did they know?

00:04:05.979 --> 00:04:07.313
There's going to be situations

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:08.781
where they're going to be read

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:10.750
back, their text messages

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.885
the text messages, their producers,

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:13.953
all kinds of correspondence

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:15.388
saying you knew

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:17.190
this was B.S., didn't you?

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.191
Today, audio

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:19.492
recordings of previously

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:20.793
unaired conversation

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:21.928
between Bartiromo

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:23.296
and then Trump attorneys Rudy

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:24.998
Giuliani and Sidney Powell

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:26.065
were made public

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:27.900
after being played in court.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.102
Giuliani and Powell,

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:30.436
two of the most vociferous

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:32.705
promoters of election lies,

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:35.074
have more than enough unobserved ballots

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:39.145
in Michigan and in Pennsylvania

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.680
to overthrow the election.

00:04:42.315 --> 00:04:43.783
Okay, perfect.

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.051
The discovery process

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:47.120
has already been bruising for Fox.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.054
With Rupert Murdoch

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:49.856
saying under oath of the election

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:51.324
denial ism on Fox,

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:52.191
I would have liked us

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:52.959
to be stronger

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:54.627
in denouncing it in hindsight.

00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:56.329
With Rupert Murdoch,

00:04:56.329 --> 00:04:59.432
he is where the entire organization

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:00.333
rots from.

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.768
He confessed

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:02.769
in a deposition

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:05.204
that he could have stopped this madness,

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:07.373
but he chose not to.

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:09.676
That's a tremendously incriminating

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.912
comment, at least journalistically.

00:05:12.912 --> 00:05:13.746
Fox says

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:15.715
it hasn't defamed anyone and says

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:16.549
the Dominion's suit

00:05:16.549 --> 00:05:17.984
is a breach of its First Amendment

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:18.818
rights.

00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:21.821
Now, Fox News is not the only entity

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:22.388
that Dominion

00:05:22.388 --> 00:05:23.122
Voting Systems

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:25.291
has gone after regarding misinformation

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:27.260
