00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:35.802
Rudy Giuliani and Sidney Powell,

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:37.804
and against two smaller right wing

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:39.272
networks, Newsmax

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:41.641
and one American News Network Wolf.

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:42.975
Brian, what are you hearing about

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:44.143
why a settlement

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:45.745
wasn't reached in this case,

00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:47.747
as some had expected?

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:49.349
Wolf, hearing from legal analysts

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:50.583
and media analysts, two things.

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:51.718
One, they believe that

00:05:51.718 --> 00:05:53.386
Dominion really has the goods on Fox.

00:05:53.386 --> 00:05:54.587
They've got a lot of incriminating

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:55.021
evidence here.

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:55.922
But also,

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:57.990
Dominion's reputation took a huge hit

00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:00.226
